# Xcode project — generated by `xcodegen generate` from project.yml (the source of
# truth). Not committed: opening the project in Xcode can silently write a personal
# Apple Developer team id or other machine-specific signing state into project.pbxproj,
# which must never land in this multi-tenant OSS repo. Run `xcodegen generate` after
# cloning (see README.md) to recreate it locally.
Maskin.xcodeproj/

xcuserdata/
*.xcuserstate
*.xcscmblueprint
DerivedData/
.build/

